Changes to DiskANN 0.7.1 at commit a26f824be5a597b49a7bf33f51ee75121e7c03af (MIT License, see DiskANN-LICENSE next
to this file). fetch_diskann.sh applies this file with git apply.

1. src/index.cpp, Index::calculate_entry_point(): the medoid is taken over the occupied locations [0, _nd) only.
   The stock InMemDataStore::calculate_medoid() averages and searches over all capacity() = _max_points +
   _num_frozen_pts locations, so in a dynamic index with free capacity the free slots, which hold zero vectors, pull
   the centroid towards the origin and can win the argmin themselves: the frozen start point becomes the origin.
   The function runs only while the index is built (generate_frozen_point() for a dynamic index, link() for a
   static one), when the points fill [0, _nd).
2. src/index.cpp, Index::reserve_location(): taking a location from the free slots clears _data_compacted. After
   load() an insert takes any free slot while the flag stayed true, so save() skipped compaction and wrote a graph
   with edges to empty locations.
3. include/index.h, include/in_mem_data_store.h: read access to the live graph (the start location, a copy of a
   location's neighbour list taken under that location's lock, the location of a tag, the vector of a location)
   for searches that run while other threads insert and delete.

